  "description": {
   "en": "“The Fukurogi Incident” — a serial murder case in which 23 murderers met their end at the hands of an active police officer, Fukurogi Nodoka. Nodoka, presumed dead after her execution, awakens to find herself informed by a mysterious girl, Lassey, that she’s been made to participate in a battle royale between resurrected heinous murderers. Nodoka, driven by the desire to prevent further atrocities by these resurrected criminals and eliminate their kind from the world, plunges into this distasteful game.",
   "ja": "『梟木事件』ーー現職警察官・梟木和によって、23人の殺人犯が犠牲となった連続殺人事件。死刑を執行されたはずの和が目を覚ますと、謎の少女・レシィーによって、『復活した凶悪殺人犯同士のバトルロイヤル』の参加者になったことを告げられる。和は復活した凶悪犯たちの蛮行の阻止、そして社会からの殺人犯の殲滅を目指し、この悪趣味な“ゲーム”に身を投じていく。"
  },
